    "chunk_text": "LAUGFS Gas says ensuring stable supply for festive season\n\nLAUGFS Gas PLC said yesterday it has successfully received an LPG shipment of 7,000 metric tons via the vessel ANDOVER at the Hambantota LAUGFS Terminal, significantly strengthening supply availability across the country and ensuring that there will be no shortages during the upcoming festive season.\n\nIt said the cargo has been sourced from SHV Energy, Netherlands, a globally recognised and highly reliable energy supplier.\n\n\u201cThis reflects LAUGFS Gas\u2019 continued focus on securing supply through strong international partnerships, even amidst ongoing global geopolitical and supply chain challenges,\u201d LAUGFS Gas PLC Director/Cluster CEO Dr. Niroshan J. Peiries said in a statement.\n\n\u201cWith this shipment, LAUGFS Gas confirms that adequate stocks have been secured to meet domestic demand throughout the festive season. The company has also taken proactive steps to expedite filling and distribution operations, ensuring that LPG is efficiently delivered across all regions. These measures are aimed at maintaining uninterrupted supply, minimising market disruptions, and providing assurance to consumers during this critical period,\u201d the statement added."
