    "md5": "655b7bcb589fad74a51ee6741873284b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1589,
    "chunk_text": "Ritzbury honoured with Sri Lanka\u2019s highest National Quality Award\n\nRitzbury, of CBL Foods International Ltd., has secured the Sri Lanka National Quality Award (SLNQA) 2023 in the Manufacturing \u2013 Large Scale category, winning it for the second time. The achievement reflects Ritzbury\u2019s continued commitment to world-class quality standards, strong governance, and the delivery of safe, reliable, and high-quality products, while contributing to Sri Lanka\u2019s industrial growth.\n\nThe award was presented at the Sri Lanka National Quality Awards ceremony organised by the Sri Lanka Standards Institution, following a rigorous, multi-stage evaluation process that benchmarks organisations against internationally recognised quality and performance excellence frameworks.\n\nThe Sri Lanka National Quality Award is regarded as the country\u2019s highest recognition for organisational excellence, modelled on globally accepted assessment systems including the Malcolm Baldrige framework. Participating organisations are evaluated across critical dimensions including leadership, strategy, customer focus, workforce engagement, process management, and measurable business results.\n\nCBL Foods International Director/CEO Kamal Geeganage said the award represents far more than external recognition. \u201cWinning the Sri Lanka National Quality Award is a strong validation of the systems, standards, and governance structures we have built over many years. It reflects our unwavering commitment to quality at every level of the organisation, from leadership and strategy to day-to-day operations.\u201d"
  },
